cff-version: 1.2.0
title: libphantom-sonar
message: >-
  A zero-dependency, zero-allocation C++20 library for ocean acoustics,
  sonar signal processing and underwater acoustic communication.
type: software
repository-code: https://github.com/Ayberk-Irmak/libphantom-sonar
authors:
  - given-names: Ayberk
    family-names: Irmak
abstract: >-
  Real-time ocean acoustics simulation: analytic ray tracing through
  piecewise-linear sound speed profiles, transmission loss and eigenrays,
  boundary reflection and reverberation, waveform synthesis and
  matched-filter detection, beamforming, multi-target tracking with IMM
  and coordinated-turn filters, and spread-spectrum acoustic
  communication. Cross-validated against Bellhop, the UNESCO sound-speed
  tables and ISO 9613-1.
keywords:
  - underwater-acoustics
  - sonar
  - ray-tracing
  - signal-processing
  - real-time
  - cpp20
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
